      "reason": "Taiwan/Hong Kong common writing uses 零用錢 for pocket money; preserve exactly three Chinese glyphs.",
      "source_url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/零用錢"
    },
    {
      "id": "trade-original-trainer-label",
      "path": "engine/movie/trade_animation.asm",
